      fallback-rect pad now source POPOVER_INSETS.pad — the reviewer found
      two live literal-8 sites the cross-exam missed; the fallback copy
      deliberately keeps lacking `right` (documented: it keeps placePopover's
      side branches unreachable for that rect, as today).
